ife.<br><br><strong>Most people</strong> you meet in your career as The Judge aim to ask for your help.<br><br><strong>But their starting points are different,</strong><br>Some are motivated by self-interest, while others hope you can make a difference in the universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042680/extras/764cada04338d1de98eb65d41d99a5cb.poster.avif?t=1736307659\" width=480 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042680/extras/764cada04338d1de98eb65d41d99a5cb.webm?t=1736307659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042680/extras/764cada04338d1de98eb65d41d99a5cb.mp4?t=1736307659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>KK</strong>, your loyal but unreliable AI consultant.<br>She wakes up together with you from unconsciousness and helps you with memory loss, <br>understand space civilization, and survive your superiors' harsh demands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042680/extras/d26ca53224ff4aee7c7ec5436e863167.poster.avif?t=1736307659\" width=480 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042680/extras/d26ca53224ff4aee7c7ec5436e863167.webm?t=1736307659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042680/extras/d26ca53224ff4aee7c7ec5436e863167.mp4?t=1736307659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Mei Silva</strong>, Aeternus, is the senior manager of a large enterprise.<br>In a specific merger, Omni extended an olive branch to you.<br>Is it for profit or other purposes?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mut